WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.652
This slide brings Module 13 together.

00:00:02.652 --> 00:00:06.122
Review the patterns you can now recognize and reuse.

00:00:06.122 --> 00:00:11.662
Focus on the decisions behind the syntax: what structure or method fits the problem,

00:00:11.662 --> 00:00:16.292
what assumptions are being made, and what you should check before trusting the result.

00:00:16.292 --> 00:00:19.272
Separate calculation from interpretation.

00:00:19.272 --> 00:00:26.842
A statistic summarizes the sample and a visualization reveals pattern, but both still require context,

00:00:26.842 --> 00:00:30.052
variability, and awareness of limitations.

00:00:30.052 --> 00:00:35.812
Before moving on, explain the main idea in one sentence without reading the slide.

00:00:35.812 --> 00:00:41.231
That quick explanation is a useful check that the concept is becoming reusable knowledge.
